        Bestill Hotel Cap Negret i perioden 17-25.04.2027.
       </a>
       </p>
       <p>
       3. Send oss et pip om at du med - via <a href="mailto:helsereis1@gmail.com" style="color:#20221D;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;">e-post</a> eller <a href="https://instagram.com/helsereis" style="color:#20221D;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;" target="_blank">Melding på Instagram!</a>
       </p>

